Required: Identify the level of the architecture (external, conceptual or internal) at which each of the following tasks would be carried out, with a brief reason:
(i) defining a rule that every admission must relate to an existing patient;
(ii) creating a screen definition for billing clerks that excludes the diagnosis field;
(iii) deciding the size of data blocks and compressing archived radiology reports;
(iv) adding an index to the PatientID field.
